          "comment": "# Train a Character\n\n**Train a Character** locks in a character's visual identity as both a reusable Storyboard Entity and a 3-angle reference sheet.\n\n1. **Reference Photo**, **Character Name**, and **Visual Descriptor** create a **StoryboardEntity** that keeps wardrobe and features consistent across shots.\n2. **ImageToImage** renders a front, three-quarter, and profile turnaround sheet keyed to your **Trigger Word**."
